The '''Large Wilds House''' is a [[:Category:Housing|housing]] [[Lots|lot]] that is available to everyone through the [[Station Cash Marketplace|SC Marketplace]] at the regular price of {{SC|750}}, and to [[Membership|Members]] at the 10% discount price of {{SC|675}}. It is the larger version of the [[Small Wilds House]].

==Description==
The house itself has 3 rooms, a front room with orange-brown walls, a back room with yellow walls and a side room with green walls. The outside walls are yellow. The fence is a combination of wood fencing and stone pillars. The yard around the house contains a tree, a path, a lantern and a few flowers.

==Dimensions==
The dimensions of the Large Wilds House are: 
*Height 40 Blocks
*Width 62 Blocks
* Length 75 Blocks
*Volume 186,000 Blocks

